<span id="S3.T1.5.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:160.0pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.5.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Brain (9,446), Heart (4,604), Liver (6,684), Stomach (1,333), Vessel (2,415), Spleen (2,732), Vertebral (4,678), Kidney (4,862)</span>
</span></td></tr>
