<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T4.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">TABLE IV</span>: </span><span id="S4.T4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Comparison with supervised and SSL baselines in Dice(%) and HD95(mm) on eight 3D segmentation datasets. Our method consistently performs well over the SOTA approaches. The best results are bolded, and the second best are underlined.</span></figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
